@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="container-fluid py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row gx-5">
            <div class="col-lg-5 mb-5 mb-lg-0" style="min-height: 500px;">
                <div class="position-relative h-100">
                    <img class="position-absolute w-100 h-100 rounded" 
                    src="~/img/about-us.jpg" alt="About Us"
                         style="object-fit: cover;">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <h5 class="d-inline-block text-primary text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">About Us</h5>
                </div>
                <p>In a world characterized by a constant surge of innovation and technological advancements, E-Medical Instruments stands as a beacon at the forefront of this dynamic landscape. We seamlessly integrate the latest breakthroughs in medical technology with the delicate art of medicine. Our unwavering mission is to empower medical professionals by providing them not only with easy access to the most cutting-edge medical appliances but also fostering an environment where they can immerse themselves in these advancements.</p>
                <p>At E-Medical Instruments, we recognize the pivotal role that staying abreast of the latest medical trends plays in delivering top-notch healthcare. We are committed to ensuring that medical practitioners not only keep pace with these innovations but actively participate in shaping the future of healthcare. Our approach is centered around making the adoption of these advancements as seamless as possible, thereby enhancing satisfaction for both patients and practitioners alike.</p>
                <p>Our dedication extends beyond merely offering the latest equipment; we strive to create a collaborative ecosystem where medical professionals can engage with and contribute to the most recent developments in the medical field. By providing easy avenues for access, education, and participation, we empower healthcare providers to deliver the highest quality of care while staying attuned to the ever-evolving landscape of modern medicine.</p>
                <p>In essence, E-Medical Instruments is more than a provider of medical equipment; we are a catalyst for progress, a facilitator of innovation, and a partner in the journey toward a future where healthcare is not just advanced but also deeply satisfying for both those who provide it and those who receive it.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
